Project Tahoe 0.2 — an Arch-based system with a macOS-styled Wayland desktop.

The desktop starts on tty1 when you log in.
For a plain shell press Ctrl+Alt+F2, or open a terminal with SUPER+Return.

Keybinds:
  SUPER+Space   Spotlight            SUPER+Return  terminal (kitty)
  SUPER+V       clipboard history    SUPER+Q       close window
  SUPER+period  emoji picker         SUPER+F       float/un-float
  Alt+Tab       app switcher         SUPER+M       maximize
  Print         screenshot           SUPER+C       center window
  Ctrl+Alt+W    wallpaper picker     SUPER+1..5    workspaces
  SUPER+L       lock screen

`sudo` asks for your password; the root account is locked.

Documentation: https://github.com/iboshka24/project-tahoe/tree/master/docs
